  "description": "Intelligent HTTP response caching for Reliable.HttpClient with comprehensive custom\n      headers support.\n      Features two distinct approaches: Generic type-safe caching (CachedHttpClient<T>) for\n      specific response types\n      and Universal caching (HttpClientWithCache) for multi-type scenarios. Includes DefaultHeaders\n      configuration,\n      per-request header support, intelligent cache key generation with header isolation,\n      preset-based\n      configuration, automatic memory management, and zero-setup convenience methods.",
  "id": "Reliable.HttpClient.Caching",
  "isPrerelease": false,
  "lastEdited": "2025-09-22T10:52:08.85Z",
